  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Huh. This pocket of Hyperspace Lumiose leaves a\nlot to be desired, doesn’t it?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is...just an old building. It looks like any you’d\nfind in the real Lumiose.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Corbeau, sir!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F00720062006500610075002C0020007300690072002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Corbeau, sir!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F00720062006500610075002C0020007300690072002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074003F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wanted to thank you properly for letting me clear\nmy debt. That huge tip was a huge relief!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wanted to thank you properly for letting me clear\nmy debt. That huge tip was a huge relief!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t forget, kid—you owe someone money, you\nowe ’em your very life.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI had a feeling we needed to be on equal footing,\nthat’s all. I might not be so generous again.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 172
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Say, since we’re all here anyway...how about a\nbattle?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300610079002C002000730069006E0063006500200077006520190072006500200061006C006C0020006800650072006500200061006E0079007700610079002E002E002E0068006F0077002000610062006F0075007400200061000A0062006100740074006C0065003F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>I’m down! You are too, right,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD06000000492019006D00200064006F0077006E002100200059006F0075002000610072006500200074006F006F002C002000720069006700680074002C000A0010000201000000003F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>I’m down! You are too, right,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD06000000492019006D00200064006F0077006E002100200059006F0075002000610072006500200074006F006F002C002000720069006700680074002C000A0010000201000000003F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Definitely!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006500660069006E006900740065006C007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uh...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550068002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, come on. Don’t keep Corbeau waiting!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200063006F006D00650020006F006E002E00200044006F006E201900740020006B00650065007000200043006F00720062006500610075002000770061006900740069006E0067002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aw, come on! You’re really gonna make Corbeau\nwait?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410077002C00200063006F006D00650020006F006E002100200059006F00752019007200650020007200650061006C006C007900200067006F006E006E00610020006D0061006B006500200043006F00720062006500610075000A0077006100690074003F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All right! We’re Team MZ’s leader and secret\nweapon. We got this!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C00200072006900670068007400210020005700652019007200650020005400650061006D0020004D005A201900730020006C0065006100640065007200200061006E00640020007300650063007200650074000A0077006500610070006F006E002E00200057006500200067006F007400200074006800690073002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All right! We’re Team MZ’s leader and secret\nweapon. We got this!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C00200072006900670068007400210020005700652019007200650020005400650061006D0020004D005A201900730020006C0065006100640065007200200061006E00640020007300650063007200650074000A0077006500610070006F006E002E00200057006500200067006F007400200074006800690073002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I aim to be a guy that my Scolipede can be proud\nof. I’ll prove myself in battle!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This will be a chance for me to remind the boss\nthat he can depend on me.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, let’s battle!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002C0020006C006500742019007300200062006100740074006C006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I need a minute, please",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006E006500650064002000610020006D0069006E007500740065002C00200070006C00650061007300650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh come on—let’s hurry up and battle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006800200063006F006D00650020006F006E2014006C006500742019007300200068007500720072007900200075007000200061006E006400200062006100740074006C0065002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll send you home crying for sure this time!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C002000730065006E006400200079006F007500200068006F006D006500200063007200790069006E006700200066006F00720020007300750072006500200074006800690073002000740069006D0065002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m as steadfast as steel, and equally patient. I\ncan wait as long as I need to.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The boss’s reputation is on the line, so don’t\nexpect me to hold back!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We can’t leave Corbeau hanging. Let’s hurry up\nand battle!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065002000630061006E201900740020006C006500610076006500200043006F00720062006500610075002000680061006E00670069006E0067002E0020004C0065007420190073002000680075007200720079002000750070000A0061006E006400200062006100740074006C0065002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We can’t leave Corbeau hanging. Let’s hurry up\nand battle!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065002000630061006E201900740020006C006500610076006500200043006F00720062006500610075002000680061006E00670069006E0067002E0020004C0065007420190073002000680075007200720079002000750070000A0061006E006400200062006100740074006C0065002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Scolipede! As long as you’re with me, I can face\nany pinch with a smile!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mega Evolution proves our bond! Let me show\nyou the true beauty of Skarmory!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m glad we get to battle together—it lets us break\nright through the limits we thought we had!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m glad we get to battle together—it lets us break\nright through the limits we thought we had!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You sure add an extra poison sting to your battles,\nCorbeau!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200073007500720065002000610064006400200061006E00200065007800740072006100200070006F00690073006F006E0020007300740069006E006700200074006F00200079006F0075007200200062006100740074006C00650073002C000A0043006F00720062006500610075002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You sure add an extra poison sting to your battles,\nCorbeau!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200073007500720065002000610064006400200061006E00200065007800740072006100200070006F00690073006F006E0020007300740069006E006700200074006F00200079006F0075007200200062006100740074006C00650073002C000A0043006F00720062006500610075002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Our teamwork still wasn’t enough to stand up to\nthe top two Trainers in the Z-A Royale.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I apologize, boss. This wouldn’t have happened if\nI were stronger...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000610070006F006C006F00670069007A0065002C00200062006F00730073002E0020005400680069007300200077006F0075006C0064006E2019007400200068006100760065002000680061007000700065006E00650064002000690066000A0049002000770065007200650020007300740072006F006E006700650072002E002E002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You did well, Philippe. You always do. I’m always\ngrateful you’re around.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Why don’t we wrap this up? We get plenty of face\ntime in the real Lumiose anyway.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Here—take this outfit. But I’ve got something to\nask of you in return.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You received Corbeau’s Suit & Tie Set!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200072006500630065006900760065006400200043006F007200620065006100752019007300200053007500690074002000260020005400690065002000530065007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See, I think Team MZ and the Rust Syndicate have\ngotten a little too...buddy-buddy lately.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So I want you to remember just how ruthless and\ndangerous the Rust Syndicate is.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWe’d happily send a beached Magikarp down to\nthe bottom of a river, or peel the skin clean off an<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nEkans trying to molt!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 211
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Point is, we got a reputation to uphold. So watch\nyourself and don’t forget who you’re dealing with!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "When all’s said and done, Lumiose will always be\nthe city that made me who I am.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t you go dressing up as the boss and\nimitating him to scare people.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aren’t Pokémon battles great?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100720065006E2019007400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200062006100740074006C00650073002000670072006500610074003F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aren’t Pokémon battles great?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100720065006E2019007400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200062006100740074006C00650073002000670072006500610074003F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
